WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:05.800
Let's show them
what we've got, Kaido.

3
00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:11.310
[BIG MOM]
The whole shebang.
We'll see how many survive.

4
00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:15.810
[cackles]

5
00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:15.810
[chuckles]

6
00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:18.770
Trafalgar! Use your power!

7
00:00:18.770 --> 00:00:21.320
Why aren't you teleporting
them downstairs?

8
00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:23.940
If I could, I would've
done it already.

9
00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:25.740
Their Haki is too strong.

10
00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:28.610
I can't get these two
outta here!

11
00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:32.280
In that case,
we'll do it by force!

12
00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:34.290
[Big Mom grunts]

13
00:00:34.290 --> 00:00:36.540
[Kaido grunts]

14
00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:40.080
Dammit! Here comes a big one!

15
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:44.090
[cackles]

16
00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:49.680
[cackles]

17
00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:14.210
I'll stretch that skin
off your skull, old man!

18
00:02:28.980 --> 00:02:32.610
I can hear their voices,
they're around here somewhere.

19
00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:34.320
I guess they got away.

20
00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:36.450
They're better than I thought!

21
00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:40.910
Hey, Zoro, you still alive?

22
00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:45.010
I think so.

23
00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:45.080
Nice job blocking that,
even for a sec. You saved us.

24
00:02:45.080 --> 00:02:47.750
Nice job blocking that,
even for a sec.

25
00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:49.640
You saved us.

26
00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:51.170
[KILLER]
Where's Straw Hat?

27
00:02:51.890 --> 00:02:53.220
[Kid, Law gasp]

28
00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:56.150
[Luffy yelling]

29
00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:57.470
[Luffy yells]

30
00:03:12.060 --> 00:03:14.360
[yells]

31
00:03:13.150 --> 00:03:14.360
[Luffy chuckles]

32
00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:14.630
[chuckles]
Hey, Kaido, you
moved. Was it gonna hurt?

33
00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:17.380
Hey Kaido, you moved.

34
00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:19.550
Was it gonna hurt?

35
00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:22.410
[Kaido yells]

36
00:03:25.330 --> 00:03:28.240
[Kaido laughs]

37
00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:15.000
<b>Conqueror's Haki</b>

38
00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:17.830
[laughing]

39
00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:21.300
Burn! That's it!
Burn it all to the ground!

40
00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:23.510
Leave nothing but ash!

41
00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:25.180
[Beast Pirates yelling]

42
00:05:25.180 --> 00:05:27.140
[BEAST PIRATE A]
It won't stop spreading!

43
00:05:27.140 --> 00:05:29.930
[BEAST PIRATE B]
Damn it!
We have enough problems already!

44
00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:32.560
[OROCHI]
Fukurokuju,
I require your expertise.

45
00:05:31.480 --> 00:05:35.110
[Orochi laughing]

46
00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:35.230
They must have a stockpile
of explosives here, right?

47
00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:37.600
[FUKUROKUJU]
Yes.
I shall take you to them.

48
00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:42.530
The castle will burn
to the ground at this rate.

49
00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:44.300
[Orochi laughing]

50
00:05:44.300 --> 00:05:46.010
[OROCHI]
Screw you, Kaido!

51
00:05:46.010 --> 00:05:48.510
And screw your New Onigashima
Project, too, damn it!

52
00:05:48.510 --> 00:05:49.930
[KIN'EMON]
Orochi!

53
00:05:49.930 --> 00:05:52.220
[DENJIRO]
So this is your doing, is it?

54
00:05:52.220 --> 00:05:54.810
Look who crawled out
of their graves again!

55
00:05:54.810 --> 00:05:57.440
I suppose you ghosts are
surprised to see me.

56
00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:00.580
What exactly is your goal here?

57
00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:02.000
It's been 20 years

58
00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:04.300
and you still won't drop
this blasted crusade!

59
00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:06.800
You hunted me down
all the way here?

60
00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:10.640
Has your hate for me really
fueled you all this time?

61
00:06:10.890 --> 00:06:13.350
[FUKUROKUJU]
Lord Orochi,
it may be worth noting

62
00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:15.480
that they didn't witness
your execution.

63
00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:18.070
Better to run. I'll handle them.

64
00:06:18.070 --> 00:06:20.320
Shut your mouth! How dare you!

65
00:06:20.320 --> 00:06:21.530
[Samurai gasp]

66
00:06:21.530 --> 00:06:23.950
It looks like you took
quite a beating!

67
00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:25.740
Is that why you've come to me?

68
00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:26.950
You're all half dead

69
00:06:26.950 --> 00:06:28.740
and you want me to
finish the job for you,

70
00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:30.830
or did somebody hit
your heads too hard

71
00:06:30.830 --> 00:06:32.750
and now you've lost your minds?

72
00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:34.460
[KIN'EMON]
Now step aside, Orochi.

73
00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:34.080
[growls]

74
00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:37.000
We won't allow you to
waste more of our time.

75
00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:39.130
And what happens if I say no?

76
00:06:39.130 --> 00:06:40.420
[DENJIRO]
What?

77
00:07:22.690 --> 00:07:24.480
[yells]

78
00:07:24.480 --> 00:07:25.940
[Orochi screams]

79
00:07:26.860 --> 00:07:29.400
[OROCHI]
Do you really think
you're the heroes here?

80
00:07:29.400 --> 00:07:32.280
Citizens are supposed to
bow before their Shogun,

81
00:07:32.280 --> 00:07:33.820
not disrupt the peace!

82
00:07:33.820 --> 00:07:36.450
Don't you know the
meaning of "authority"?

83
00:07:36.450 --> 00:07:37.540
[Okiku yells]

84
00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:38.620
[Orochi roars]

85
00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:28.000
Lord Orochi!

86
00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:30.900
I'll let them decide
your punishment in hell.

87
00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:32.450
Onward!

88
00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:34.820
[growls]

89
00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:37.580
[RAIZO]
Are you going
to avenge your lord?

90
00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:39.830
Seems you have some
integrity, after all.

91
00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:41.410
Even though he was a fool,

92
00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:43.790
you stayed loyal
to him till the end.

93
00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:46.670
Ironic, hearing that
from you of all people.

94
00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:48.840
But you and I are
destined to fight.

95
00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:51.130
I don't need vengeance
as an excuse.

96
00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:53.420
Wouldn't you agree, Raizo?

97
00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:54.640
Indeed!

98
00:09:02.350 --> 00:09:04.020
[yells]

99
00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:11.820
[yells]

100
00:10:27.100 --> 00:10:28.230
[Zeus laughs]

101
00:10:33.880 --> 00:10:34.960
It's done.

102
00:10:34.960 --> 00:10:35.150
My turn! Now, Room!

103
00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:37.380
My turn. Now, Room!

104
00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:38.880
Shambles!

105
00:10:38.880 --> 00:10:42.760
Huh? Where am I? It's dark!

106
00:10:42.760 --> 00:10:44.340
Damn it, Zeus!

107
00:10:44.340 --> 00:10:46.540
[KILLER]
Can you do it, Roronoa?

108
00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:48.310
[ZORO]
Do I have a choice?

109
00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:51.960
[ZORO yells]

110
00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:54.400
[Big Mom gasps]

111
00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:57.050
[ZORO]
I won't let you go back to her!

112
00:10:57.050 --> 00:11:00.760
Flame-Rend...
Crossing the Six Paths!

113
00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:02.640
[Prometheus screams]

114
00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:04.010
[NAPOLEON]
No, no, no!
Stop the violence!

115
00:11:04.010 --> 00:11:06.100
I'm just an innocent sword!

116
00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:08.940
[NAPOLEON, PROMETHEUS, ZEUS]
– Mama! Help me, please!
– Mama! Help me, please!

117
00:11:08.940 --> 00:11:10.190
I'm coming!

118
00:11:14.960 --> 00:11:16.690
[BIG MOM]
Pathetic!

119
00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:16.750
You thought you could win if you
took my homies away, huh?

120
00:11:16.750 --> 00:11:20.010
You thought you could win if
you took my homies away, huh?

121
00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:22.130
I'll crush you!

122
00:11:22.130 --> 00:11:26.120
[Kid groans]

123
00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:26.280
[gasps]

124
00:11:26.280 --> 00:11:28.720
Don't push it, hag!

125
00:11:30.060 --> 00:11:31.620
Repel!

126
00:11:31.180 --> 00:11:32.180
[gasps]

127
00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:35.080
And Takt!

128
00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:37.880
[gasps]

129
00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:39.260
You idiot!

130
00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:42.030
You think you'll beat me
by hitting me with a rock?

131
00:11:48.740 --> 00:11:51.230
[BIG MOM]
Huh? Uh-oh!

132
00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:56.230
[Big Mom screams]

133
00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:57.000
[gasps]

134
00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:58.500
[ZEUS]
Mama!

135
00:11:58.500 --> 00:11:58.690
If there's no one to catch her,
then that's one down!

136
00:11:58.690 --> 00:12:01.900
If there's no one to catch
her, then that's one down!

137
00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:03.410
[screams]

138
00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:05.410
How was that?

139
00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:50.620
How is he standing?

140
00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:53.330
That attack probably broke
half of his bones.

141
00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:55.160
What is he made of?

142
00:12:56.110 --> 00:12:59.660
Pathetic, Linlin.
You got sloppy.

143
00:13:00.510 --> 00:13:03.340
Guess I gotta do this
job on my own.

144
00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:04.800
[Killer laughs]

145
00:13:05.890 --> 00:13:07.810
Hey, Pirate Hunter!

146
00:13:08.650 --> 00:13:11.610
Let him go! I'm warning you!

147
00:13:13.780 --> 00:13:15.400
Time for Shambles!

148
00:13:19.240 --> 00:13:21.200
[LAW]
Injection Shot!

149
00:13:24.960 --> 00:13:29.500
I don't know what you did,
but I don't like it one bit!

150
00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:30.590
Now die!

151
00:13:35.020 --> 00:13:36.320
[groans]

152
00:13:37.590 --> 00:13:39.130
Mama!

153
00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:42.090
Agh! Go away!

154
00:13:42.090 --> 00:13:47.760
[PROMETHEUS]
Hold on! I'm coming! Mama!

155
00:13:55.690 --> 00:13:57.860
Pull it together, Traffy!

156
00:13:57.860 --> 00:14:00.740
That fire thing,
it's gonna save Big Mom

157
00:14:00.740 --> 00:14:02.490
if we don't do something quick!

158
00:14:05.220 --> 00:14:07.430
I-It doesn't matter. Let it go.

159
00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:11.660
[LAW]
I don't want one of us to die.

160
00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:15.290
I'd rather have
the mission fail.

161
00:14:19.090 --> 00:14:20.340
[growling]

162
00:14:22.260 --> 00:14:23.970
[KID]
You don't have to worry;

163
00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:27.300
all we had to do was tear
Big Mom and Kaido apart.

164
00:14:28.350 --> 00:14:32.060
We've come far enough, no need
to throw your lives away.

165
00:14:32.480 --> 00:14:33.980
[laughs]

166
00:14:41.570 --> 00:14:42.820
[growling]

167
00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:50.460
That sure was a close
one, wasn't it?

168
00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:53.870
[Big Mom chuckles]

169
00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:57.420
Oh, my sweet,
adorable Prometheus!

170
00:14:57.420 --> 00:14:59.250
Thank you so much!

171
00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:00.710
[chuckles]

172
00:15:01.400 --> 00:15:03.820
But somebody didn't bother!

173
00:15:03.820 --> 00:15:05.860
Zeus! Where the hell are you?

174
00:15:06.820 --> 00:15:08.570
That useless idiot!

175
00:15:11.360 --> 00:15:12.820
What a pity.

176
00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:15.700
He really let you
down, didn't he?

177
00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:18.580
You can't rely on that lazy
chump to do anything,

178
00:15:18.580 --> 00:15:20.120
if you ask me!

179
00:15:22.890 --> 00:15:27.020
[PROMETHEUS]
I don't suppose I
could ask for a favor, could I?

180
00:15:27.020 --> 00:15:29.110
[BIG MOM]
Hm? What is it?

181
00:15:40.400 --> 00:15:41.480
[laughs]

182
00:15:49.710 --> 00:15:53.370
That's funny! Can you
believe that face?

183
00:15:53.370 --> 00:15:57.560
That cold stare,
just like last time!

184
00:15:57.560 --> 00:16:01.360
Even though he's unconscious,
the boy's still glaring at me.

185
00:16:01.360 --> 00:16:05.030
You got something you
wanna say, you little punk?

186
00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:10.010
If you don't get up soon,

187
00:16:10.010 --> 00:16:13.300
I'm gonna smash those
eyeballs right in.

188
00:16:13.890 --> 00:16:16.350
And then the rest of your skull.

189
00:16:16.350 --> 00:16:20.770
And your face.
And your heart, too!

190
00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:22.060
Hey,

191
00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:26.840
I got one good move left in me.

192
00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:29.670
And it's gonna push
me to the limit.

193
00:16:30.440 --> 00:16:31.780
You're kidding me.

194
00:16:31.780 --> 00:16:34.570
Anything less than my
best wouldn't be enough.

195
00:16:34.900 --> 00:16:36.660
It would just wear me down.

196
00:16:38.470 --> 00:16:40.800
Either this attack
works, or I die.

197
00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:42.120
Maybe it's my time to go.

198
00:16:42.120 --> 00:16:46.420
If this is it for me...
good luck.

199
00:16:59.550 --> 00:17:01.340
[ZORO]
Hey, Kaido!

200
00:17:05.680 --> 00:17:08.520
[ZORO]
I got a duty
to protect my captain!

201
00:17:11.180 --> 00:17:14.230
[ZORO]
You wanna smash
a head in that bad?

202
00:17:14.230 --> 00:17:17.320
Try mine first,
if you think you can!

203
00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:17.830
<b>ASURA</b>
<b>BLADES</b>
<b>DRAWN</b>

204
00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:21.040
<b>DEAD MAN'S</b>
<b>GAME</b>

205
00:18:58.520 --> 00:19:02.780
So you have it as well...
That was Conqueror's Haki.

206
00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:04.910
[ZORO]
Tch. Oh, yeah?

207
00:19:04.910 --> 00:19:06.950
Y'think that means
something to me?

208
00:19:09.090 --> 00:19:11.920
Whatever you call it,
it still wasn't enough.

209
00:19:13.940 --> 00:19:14.340
That was all my strength
and you barely even flinched.

210
00:19:14.340 --> 00:19:18.390
That was all my strength,
and you barely even flinched.

211
00:19:22.110 --> 00:19:26.070
[ZORO]
I was hoping... you'd
fall to your knees... at least.

212
00:19:26.070 --> 00:19:28.070
Well, you should be proud, kid.

213
00:19:29.240 --> 00:19:29.480
You've given me a scar
that will never fade.

214
00:19:29.480 --> 00:19:31.890
Give me a scar that
will never fade,

215
00:19:40.350 --> 00:19:43.480
Your generation has
certainly earned its name.

216
00:19:49.990 --> 00:19:52.570
Zoro, run! Hurry!

217
00:19:57.450 --> 00:19:59.660
You stay right there.

218
00:19:59.660 --> 00:20:02.830
Save yourself the trouble,
I'll come to you.

219
00:20:10.090 --> 00:20:11.220
[Law groans]

220
00:20:30.600 --> 00:20:32.560
It's a damn shame.

221
00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:36.740
If you joined me, we could've
conquered the world together.

222
00:20:36.740 --> 00:20:38.250
If we joined you?

223
00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:41.620
Why the hell would
we ever join you?

224
00:20:44.870 --> 00:20:48.250
[LUFFY]
We'll do anything
to help the samurai.

225
00:20:52.790 --> 00:20:55.890
[LUFFY]
I'll kick your ass,
no matter what!

226
00:20:55.890 --> 00:20:57.850
[KAIDO]
You wanna repeat that?

227
00:20:59.090 --> 00:21:01.930
You'll kick my ass?

228
00:21:10.100 --> 00:21:10.560
[KAIDO]
Fine. Try it, then.

229
00:21:10.560 --> 00:21:13.560
All right, go ahead
and try it, then.

230
00:21:13.560 --> 00:21:17.150
You're not the type to think
before you punch, are you?

231
00:21:17.150 --> 00:21:20.650
If you got something
left, show me!

232
00:21:25.790 --> 00:21:27.790
[HYOGORO]
You need to pull back!

233
00:21:27.790 --> 00:21:29.120
It's quite simple.

234
00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:30.160
"Haki," as you call it,
coats your entire body.

235
00:21:30.160 --> 00:21:32.000
coats your outside

236
00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:32.130
It can be used as armor,
and also as a weapon

237
00:21:32.130 --> 00:21:35.500
It can be used as invisible
armor or as a weapon.

238
00:21:32.380 --> 00:21:34.880
[yells]

239
00:21:35.550 --> 00:21:36.500
And then, when you push
beyond its limits,

240
00:21:36.500 --> 00:21:38.120
However, when you push
that power beyond its limits

241
00:21:38.120 --> 00:21:38.590
your Haki doesn't simply
fortify your strength

242
00:21:38.590 --> 00:21:41.340
your Haki doesn't simply
fortify your strength,

243
00:21:41.340 --> 00:21:45.970
it penetrates the enemy's body
and destroys it from within.

244
00:21:41.960 --> 00:21:43.170
[gasps]

245
00:21:46.060 --> 00:21:48.690
[COUGHS]

246
00:21:48.690 --> 00:21:48.940
Don't overstress yourself!

247
00:21:48.940 --> 00:21:50.900
[HYOGORO]
Don't overstress yourself!

248
00:21:50.900 --> 00:21:52.440
Let the Haki flow to your fist

249
00:21:52.440 --> 00:21:55.440
from the parts that
aren't using it!

250
00:21:57.400 --> 00:21:59.950
...Kong Gun!

251
00:22:05.740 --> 00:22:07.980
The last time,
it was too shallow.

252
00:22:07.980 --> 00:22:08.630
In the midst of danger
